<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>NCS 취업준비 과정 수요조사</title>

  <!-- 카카오톡 / SNS 미리보기 -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="졸특 PICK | NCS 취업준비 과정 수요조사" />
  <meta
    property="og:description"
    content="11/2~11/5 · 18:00~21:00 예정 · NCS 진단검사부터 기업 준비전략·모의시험까지"
  />
  <meta
    property="og:url"
    content="https://36onepasslounge.github.io/pick/ncs/"
  />
  <meta
    property="og:image"
    content="https://36onepasslounge.github.io/pick/ncs/og-ncs.png"
  />
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Pretendard, "Noto Sans KR", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff7fb 0%, #f4f3ff 100%);
      color: #111827;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      width: min(620px, 100%);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.97);
      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 34px 26px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(91,77,242,.12);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0 0 auto 0;
      height: 8px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ef4444 0%, #6d5efc 100%);
    }

    .pick {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ef4444;
      background: #fff1f2;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin: 8px 0 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 7vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1.4px;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: #6d5efc;
    }

    .lead {
      margin: 16px 0 22px;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .info {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #faf8ff 0%, #f7f5ff 100%);
      border: 1px solid #e8e2ff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 17px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .question {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 17px;
      padding: 18px 15px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 900;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: .16s ease;
    }

    button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    button:disabled {
      opacity: .55;
      cursor: default;
      transform: none;
    }

    .yes {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d5efc 0%, #5b4df2 100%);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(109,94,252,.22);
    }

    .no {
      background: white;
      color: #111827;
      border: 1px solid #ebe9ff;
    }

    .reason-box {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fbfaff;
      border: 1px solid #ede9ff;
    }

    .reason-title {
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 11px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #5b4df2;
    }

    .reason-buttons {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .reason-buttons button {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e7e3ff;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 13px 12px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff4f6 0%, #f6f3ff 100%);
      color: #6b21a8;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid #f4d7df;
    }

    #message {
      margin-top: 16px;
      min-height: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #6d5efc;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="card">

    <div class="pick">졸특 PICK</div>

    <h1>
      NCS 취업준비 과정,<br>
      <span>참여하시겠어요?</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="lead">
      NCS 진단검사부터 기업 준비전략,<br>
      실전 모의시험까지 한 번에 준비합니다.
    </div>

    <div class="info">
      📅 <strong>11/2(월) ~ 11/5(목), 4일간</strong><br>
      🕕 <strong>18:00 ~ 21:00 예정</strong><br>
      ⏰ 1일 3시간 × 4일 = 총 12시간<br>
      📌 NCS 진단검사 · 기업 준비전략 · NCS 대비교육 · 모의시험
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      참여 가능 여부를 알려주세요!
    </div>

    <div class="buttons">

      <form
        id="yesForm"
        action="https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbyc3EoRU_u1rxLSyFYeUYXHbks2y-hDP5YPyRPkTeC2DFZGAFjV5OVudG4euwcjXb8/exec"
        method="POST"
        target="hiddenFrame"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="answer" value="참여하고 싶어요">
        <input type="hidden" name="reason" value="">

        <button class="yes" type="submit">
          🙋 참여할래요
        </button>
      </form>

      <button class="no" id="noButton" type="button">
        🙅 참여가 어려워요
      </button>

    </div>

    <div class="reason-box" id="reasonBox">

      <div class="reason-title">
        참여가 어려운 이유를 알려주세요.
      </div>

      <div class="reason-buttons">

        <button type="button" data-reason="일정이 맞지 않아요">
          📅 일정이 맞지 않아요
        </button>

        <button type="button" data-reason="시간이 맞지 않아요">
          🕕 시간이 맞지 않아요
        </button>

        <button type="button" data-reason="NCS 과정이 필요하지 않아요">
          📚 NCS 과정이 필요하지 않아요
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          data-reason="다른 일정 또는 취업 준비가 있어요"
        >
          💼 다른 일정 또는 취업 준비가 있어요
        </button>

        <button type="button" data-reason="기타">
          ✏️ 기타
        </button>

      </div>
    </div>

    <form
      id="noForm"
      action="https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbyc3EoRU_u1rxLSyFYeUYXHbks2y-hDP5YPyRPkTeC2DFZGAFjV5OVudG4euwcjXb8/exec"
      method="POST"
      target="hiddenFrame"
      style="display:none;"
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="answer" value="참여가 어려워요">
      <input type="hidden" name="reason" id="reasonInput" value="">
    </form>

    <div class="notice">
      ※ 본 일정은 가계획이며, 수요조사 결과에 따라 일정 및 운영시간은 조정될 수 있습니다.
    </div>

    <div id="message"></div>

    <iframe
      name="hiddenFrame"
      style="display:none;"
    ></iframe>

  </main>

  <script>
    const yesForm = document.getElementById("yesForm");
    const noForm = document.getElementById("noForm");
    const noButton = document.getElementById("noButton");
    const reasonBox = document.getElementById("reasonBox");
    const reasonInput = document.getElementById("reasonInput");
    const message = document.getElementById("message");
    const allButtons = document.querySelectorAll("button");

    function finishVote() {
      localStorage.setItem("ncsSurvey2026", "done");

      allButtons.forEach(btn => {
        btn.disabled = true;
      });

      reasonBox.style.display = "none";
      message.textContent = "응답 완료! 감사합니다 🙌";
    }

    if (localStorage.getItem("ncsSurvey2026")) {
      allButtons.forEach(btn => {
        btn.disabled = true;
      });

      message.textContent = "이미 응답했어요. 감사합니다!";
    }

    yesForm.addEventListener("submit", () => {
      finishVote();
    });

    noButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
      reasonBox.style.display = "block";

      reasonBox.scrollIntoView({
        behavior: "smooth",
        block: "nearest"
      });
    });

    document
      .querySelectorAll("[data-reason]")
      .forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          reasonInput.value = btn.dataset.reason;
          noForm.submit();
          finishVote();
        });
      });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
